SkyFall

The Sky is pure black. stars twinkle and turn very slow. Every few seconds a star falls acroos the screen with a sparks behind it.

Features

Stars in the balck Sky
The total sky turns slowly.
Stars falls every 2 to 5 seconds.
click anywhere to make a star fall.

Images are upload in the form of files.

How to run it

Clone the git Repo 



Download it and run in the broswer

             "OR"

Run through the deployed link.




To create an interactive picec of digital art that makes a site look amazing.It uses only HTML , CSS , and JavaScript.